  "problem": "A partitioned matrix $M$ contains the following blocks: \n\n- ${M}_{11},$ which is a $3\\times 3$ block\n\n- ${M}_{12},$ which is a $3\\times 2$ block\n\n- ${M}_{21},$ which is a $2\\times 3$ block\n\nWhat are the dimensions of ${M}_{22}?$",
